msgid "The creator cannot be removed from their own challenge."
msgstr "El creador no puede ser eliminado de su propio reto."

#: challenges/views.py:1091
msgid "This participant cannot be removed."
msgstr "Este participante no se puede eliminar."

#: challenges/views.py:1109
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s has been removed from the challenge."
msgstr "%(name)s ha sido eliminado/a del reto."

#: challenges/views.py:1116 challenges/views.py:1127
msgid "Remove Participant"
msgstr "Eliminar Participante"

#: challenges/views.py:1117
#, python-format
msgid "remove %(name)s from"
msgstr "eliminar a %(name)s de"

#: challenges/views.py:1119
msgid ""
"Removing freezes their scoring — no further points will be earned for them "
"in this challenge. Their past entries stay on the leaderboard. They cannot "
"rejoin on their own; re-inviting them readmits them. This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar congela su puntuación — no ganará más puntos en este reto. "
"Sus entradas anteriores permanecerán en la clasificación. No puede volver a "
"unirse por su cuenta; volver a invitarlo lo readmite. Esta acción no se "
"puede deshacer."

#: challenges/views.py:1169
msgid "Only pending invitations can be revoked."
msgstr "Solo se pueden revocar las invitaciones pendientes."

#: challenges/views.py:1188
#, python-format
msgid "The invitation for %(name)s has been revoked."
msgstr "Se ha revocado la invitación de %(name)s."

#: challenges/views.py:1195 challenges/views.py:1204
msgid "Revoke Invitation"
msgstr "Revocar Invitación"

#: challenges/views.py:1196
#, python-format
msgid "revoke the invitation for %(name)s to"
msgstr "revocar la invitación de %(name)s para"

#: challenges/views.py:1198
msgid ""
"The pending invitation is withdrawn. They are not notified, and they can be "
"re-invited at any time."
msgstr ""
"La invitación pendiente se retira. No se le notifica, y puede ser invitado "
"de nuevo en cualquier momento."

#: challenges/views.py:1217
msgid "This challenge can no longer be closed."
msgstr "Este reto ya no se puede cerrar."

#: challenges/views.py:1226
msgid "Challenge closed."
msgstr "Reto cerrado."

#: challenges/views.py:1232 challenges/views.py:1241
msgid "Close Challenge"
msgstr "Cerrar Reto"

#: challenges/views.py:1233
msgid "close"
msgstr "cerrar"

#: challenges/views.py:1234
msgid " early"
msgstr " anticipadamente"

#: challenges/views.py:1236
msgid ""
"Closing runs a final sync for every participant, locks the leaderboard, and "
"notifies everyone that the challenge has ended. This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Cerrar ejecuta una sincronización final para cada participante, bloquea la "
"clasificación y notifica a todos que el reto ha terminado. Esta "
"acción no se puede deshacer."

#: challenges/views.py:1270
msgid "This challenge can no longer be renamed."
msgstr "Este reto ya no se puede renombrar."

#: challenges/views.py:1283
msgid "Challenge name updated."
msgstr "Nombre del reto actualizado."

#: challenges/views.py:1328
msgid "This challenge's visibility can no longer be changed."
msgstr "La visibilidad de este reto ya no se puede cambiar."

#: challenges/views.py:1337
msgid "Challenge is now invite only. New members can only join by invite."
msgstr ""
"El reto ahora es solo por invitación. Los nuevos miembros solo pueden "
"unirse por invitación."

#: challenges/views.py:1341
msgid "Challenge is now open. Anyone can find and join it."
msgstr ""
"El reto ahora está abierto. Cualquiera puede encontrarlo y unirse."

#: challenges/views.py:1369
msgid "This challenge's ownership can no longer be transferred."
msgstr "La propiedad de este reto ya no se puede transferir."

#: challenges/views.py:1394
msgid "Ownership can only be transferred to an active, accepted participant."
msgstr ""
"La propiedad solo se puede transferir a un participante activo y aceptado."

#: challenges/views.py:1419
#, python-format
msgid "Ownership transferred to %(name)s."
msgstr "Propiedad transferida a %(name)s."

#: challenges/views.py:1426 challenges/views.py:1439
msgid "Transfer Ownership"
msgstr "Transferir Propiedad"

#: challenges/views.py:1427
msgid "transfer ownership of"
msgstr "transferir la propiedad de"

#: challenges/views.py:1428
#, python-format
msgid " to %(name)s"
msgstr " a %(name)s"

#: challenges/views.py:1430
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s will gain full control of this challenge — closing, cancelling, "
"inviting, and removing participants. You will remain a regular participant. "
"Only the new owner can transfer ownership back to you, so this cannot be "
"undone on your own."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s obtendrá el control total de este reto — cerrar, cancelar, "
"invitar y eliminar participantes. Tú seguirás siendo un participante normal. "
"Solo el nuevo propietario puede transferirte la propiedad de vuelta, por lo "
"que no puedes deshacer esto por tu cuenta."

#: challenges/views.py:1457
msgid "This challenge can no longer be cancelled."
msgstr "Este reto ya no se puede cancelar."

#: challenges/views.py:1467
msgid "Challenge cancelled."
msgstr "Reto cancelado."

#: challenges/views.py:1473 challenges/views.py:1482
#: templates/challenges/settings.html:49
msgid "Cancel Challenge"
msgstr "Cancelar Reto"

#: challenges/views.py:1474
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "cancelar"

#: challenges/views.py:1476
msgid ""
"Cancelling voids the challenge entirely — no final sync runs, no scores "
"are recorded, and no closing notifications are sent. The challenge is "
"removed from the Find Challenges list. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Cancelar anula el reto por completo — no se ejecuta ninguna "
"sincronización final, no se registra ninguna puntuación y no se envían "
"notificaciones de cierre. El reto se elimina de la lista de Buscar "
"Retos. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

#: challenges/views.py:1484
msgid "Go Back"
msgstr "Volver"

